#: scenario3:scenario3_FD388E09_8B10_4CDF_8E5C_1549B97DC055
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c27c02db60e2d175a47dfa1c57ff97459ba18510386ecca66959e50dc0a005c
#. default-sha256: 6b61aa0ba20a7febed03301577187e4a65399001fb66af97c67260c8b39201d0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD388E09_8B10_4CDF_8E5C_1549B97DC055"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The Pacific Railroad’s “Last Spike” ceremony was drawing nearer by "
"the day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫La cosiddetta “Last Spike”, la cerimonia inaugurale della Pacific "
"Railroad, si stava avvicinando."

#: scenario3:scenario3_10FBEF3D_2159_4CF1_B0E0_3CE07EF4BF2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10bda9e47d2da2a8afa5f36b89a289cd4f9f3bad8ccac9bca2abe7b6e5a24526
#. default-sha256: a579390b337f93980b881305911813a8d7ab54cc9f7ef52b0562b06289e83ebe
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_10FBEF3D_2159_4CF1_B0E0_3CE07EF4BF2E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That day was, coincidentally, the deadline the two of them had set for themselves—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"Jacopo to confront his wife, and the White-Haired Girl to wait for him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per coincidenza, quel giorno era la scadenza che i due si erano prefissati—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Jacopo "
"per affrontare sua moglie, e la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi per aspettarlo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_49D5AE19_E4BA_4311_A29D_1D4FFF10B3ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93fe805e4e9b587ec53b5d8c96bbb136df2fc3fdb1fe60dcc0fbccc2070da8b8
#. default-sha256: 4bf6b9bb2b33c50452498f40abc95d16e2c7aa9414896327a4caf3c50c487c06
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_49D5AE19_E4BA_4311_A29D_1D4FFF10B3ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And as that day approached, she continued to write letters."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E mentre quel giorno si avvicinava,⟪k:1⟫lei continuava a scrivere le sue lettere."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7236BB12_217D_4031_A3C7_DCFE8DEE849F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59637da3a778da79bdd96a65ee18ec2e9f64001582e8f1cafc4afe58a34172cd
#. default-sha256: 5285b26963e6bdf420b383172c65bc008d54855463a4439a0d815a252d340864
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7236BB12_217D_4031_A3C7_DCFE8DEE849F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wrote the letters purely by force of habit,⟪k:1⟫despite having been worn visibly thin."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era spinta esclusivamente dalla forza dell’abitudine,⟪k:1⟫nonostante fosse visibilmente "
"stremata."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FBE7FD54_B9BA_41B4_9C1F_473C3A1FC584
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6c6632f63afcbb7a049da4416459cdff2d940c2ccf682eac3f17d41f65c0327
#. default-sha256: c14bf92ea2ab5748275efe547b832de6ba516f134713eb7fc8fe43a524760c73
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FBE7FD54_B9BA_41B4_9C1F_473C3A1FC584"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I expect that she could not stop—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that the act of writing was all that kept her "
"from going mad."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Suppongo che non riuscisse a fermarsi—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫che l’atto di scrivere fosse tutto ciò che "
"le impediva di impazzire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DDEF16C4_2820_4312_A143_35094965C838
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23045b1f32c6d7ce3d61b7d3ed1e4350455eb859820a35725b7ad4ca88da5dd8
#. default-sha256: 076b65c3e1fb6eae1f73cfb12a4143f9b06d2588b66d6f46629df40be1cc0e81
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DDEF16C4_2820_4312_A143_35094965C838"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By focusing her attention on another person through her letters, she was able to maintain "
"her grip on herself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Concentrando la sua attenzione su un’altra persona attraverso le proprie lettere, riusciva a "
"mantenere il controllo di sé."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4CCA9C38_1121_4241_B109_6722D3A9183F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a76014282dff21d3b0fa07b368891c036d11d0e73e09f9154b57c267b86d458
#. default-sha256: a23bb5961b6c62c5fbc91ebd12fc84d5a3de2a578a0698e237ea8b619bb3b3aa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4CCA9C38_1121_4241_B109_6722D3A9183F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that day would put an end to her suffering and despair.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When the railroad was "
"completed, all their misunderstandings would be cleared up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma quel giorno avrebbe messo fine alla sua sofferenza e alla sua disperazione.⟪k:1⟫ Al "
"completamento della ferrovia, tutti i loro equivoci sarebbero stati chiariti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FA08EFD_A6FB_4CC2_A94F_14E38A5A6665
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cba579876d5ec532f972d18abef96cc9b4442e4fb94f152ffbc3be0b459ae2d
#. default-sha256: c16913528ed60f422fa19b3470c3e0f4f836bc725bb0475e21a93389db994cfc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FA08EFD_A6FB_4CC2_A94F_14E38A5A6665"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They would return to the smiling, happy couple they had been when they were first married."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sarebbero tornati a essere la felice coppia sorridente di quel giorno."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D47C7A99_4FBB_4EC8_B49A_C33745E2AA47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ebc554860773839c46bcf4efa42862fe898cc64b2ed46d4b92b049c12b458e3
#. default-sha256: 17a388ae56784af16337a1d7f143551a5b90b40295bb8469f1604ee67446e879
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D47C7A99_4FBB_4EC8_B49A_C33745E2AA47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The harsh winter would finally come to a close, melting away into the past and allowing them "
"to step into the future."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il vento freddo avrebbe finalmente smesso di infuriare,⟪k:1⟫permettendo loro di andare "
"avanti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A818C79_BCA8_46DB_8D77_99A0AB587962
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a5c627a535d65ae86a5a67413e832857a4b9a9b2200bad53927fc2c06cdb5df
#. default-sha256: f16bd74556d17111324a86d180bed58842157036cb9dc50e41b82111d7784937
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9A818C79_BCA8_46DB_8D77_99A0AB587962"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With constant prayer in my heart, I impatiently awaited the railroad’s opening ceremony."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Attendevo con impazienza la cerimonia d’apertura della ferrovia, pregando ogni giorno."

#: scenario3:scenario3_69CAAA81_630D_42F6_8BE1_2427A5D15C72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d887ab56bbbeef30d0266377e1219e90fe47b3f36c38018ef3300efae9453866
#. default-sha256: 44992b8830298208090c5ea6f1ec412b1c4c4f10879fc06731fb70b8816216f8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_69CAAA81_630D_42F6_8BE1_2427A5D15C72"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I do not, after all, wish for anyone to fall into any kind of misfortune..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Del resto, desidero che nessuno cada vittima di alcuna disgrazia..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7C82EAD2_E1F7_4235_A164_E19C0AD1C3ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79d21c09b8a9ae23d8a7396d99b22c1d5beed06c272ed9e9e79db6e7a74beb66
#. default-sha256: d30135ce2469443b863413edca220e3c35b336f3743f533a6fefb52ee67c2b92
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7C82EAD2_E1F7_4235_A164_E19C0AD1C3ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And that goes for you as well, Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E questo vale anche per lei, Padrone."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0B419369_3A6E_416B_8CD3_7BF4E12CB384
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8e354d5e10d3dd6bf25e3d4fa9caa2f18087a548a0a079689f25a099e88c216
#. default-sha256: 41ad3342c47c2ca8f32deab6f5f02c21db56ba39e82fd00a3395046ecfcf7bff
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0B419369_3A6E_416B_8CD3_7BF4E12CB384"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, Master... ⟪k:1⟫The door is soon to be shut upon this era."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dunque... ⟪k:1⟫La porta di quest’epoca verrà presto chiusa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A5EBDE59_069C_4707_A7D6_63C1CCC2AA45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee374d3975088fb5c8be30edd6ddf82002f26f5a0dc8afbdc552780283ff8bb7
#. default-sha256: b4b61eef1b5082d199555b20023cfe0777d4335416b514bf33bbcdea4c7cfa7b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A5EBDE59_069C_4707_A7D6_63C1CCC2AA45"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you prepared to see what happens next?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I see. Very well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mi dica, se la sente di proseguire?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Capisco... ⟪k:3⟫Molto bene, allora."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D5AC5A40_6B95_41CC_81F9_2E678752541F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a40068ae836f6802284fdac30f1d4e112aa509d5e9142a01a0c26140caabc44
#. default-sha256: 7dcec8475b26fed8e6789525ebfd16850e65477f628aaab32ec93e4b89308711
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D5AC5A40_6B95_41CC_81F9_2E678752541F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Then allow us to make our way to that final day.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫See with your own eyes, Master, "
"how this tale concludes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Giungiamo, dunque, a quel giorno finale.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Guardi con i suoi occhi, Padrone, come si "
"conclude questo racconto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5CA27902_7BE1_4C88_B5E6_E3257157761D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0cdb102913275a22d6d116cedc9d86847f1ab4195d537e942dab0fe3b9372afa
#. default-sha256: 868df30ab0f363a43884bfbee0d7c06dbdcc5ef9c9875d80d8b586899d326e03
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5CA27902_7BE1_4C88_B5E6_E3257157761D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And please... ⟪k:1⟫do not let go of my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E la prego... ⟪k:1⟫non lasci la mia mano."

#: scenario3:scenario3_38183C3A_5A49_49E9_9078_137F657FA40A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0297a4d1107a097abdd060cb916544a518bc90b11478857581ffdbde51dd51bd
#. default-sha256: 4658fa56634218cd50ab80a2f9c9ea92209076e6579836508eab2ac5ddafabce
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38183C3A_5A49_49E9_9078_137F657FA40A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫.................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫.................."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D4A6FA98_A7C3_4324_8BC0_7853D9A17202
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 261105573dbba987cefadd88bb03f4b753b120a49228c87b88b578a0dd3e8e73
#. default-sha256: a571824d01f2479cff7be865def26395923211e06f3eef0b757d90dc0083d966
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D4A6FA98_A7C3_4324_8BC0_7853D9A17202"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The night before the opening ceremony, the master of the house headed for his wife’s shed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La sera prima della cerimonia, il padrone di casa si diresse al capanno."

#: scenario3:scenario3_00629B75_CB74_4C66_AEB9_43218111BC59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20dfcb1ccc0c85268b9954bc39972f2ac8cd1c72f37dcd3b2cdce13f12d4b674
#. default-sha256: 0a7ac7a85890082dd6fb3fd8f50e92a35bf5ff272cd9fa6ad720b5ea77143200
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_00629B75_CB74_4C66_AEB9_43218111BC59"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a tension on his face, but a surety in his step.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He had found the resolve "
"to speak with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’era tensione sul suo volto, ma sicurezza nel suo passo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Era finalmente "
"determinato a parlare con lei."

#: scenario3:scenario3_07151B49_FE0E_49DD_BCB1_6B1E509795E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cff73e9fb128bc25b0f1699d76953dae772958b8ddff9661cd80e945a0d7a6f8
#. default-sha256: 0c8317100123e8b700876aa5b8bfbaf6650c956741f6165276b81375e1d71597
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_07151B49_FE0E_49DD_BCB1_6B1E509795E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having locked her away for so long in the shed like a common prisoner, Jacopo was hardly "
"optimistic about what she might say to him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avendola rinchiusa per così tanto tempo nel capanno come un prigioniero qualunque, Jacopo "
"non era affatto ottimista riguardo a⟪k:1⟫ciò che lei avrebbe potuto dirgli."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74DF934A_2B1D_4AC2_A228_28F59D2EFD3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d706383dea7b26c0d0a54275299827cf45dd4a8f70cd832527e39fc114d8e470
#. default-sha256: c4be16571f8daddb0bcab1f8fc3008e922513f6e7925a88286514ec95262f50a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74DF934A_2B1D_4AC2_A228_28F59D2EFD3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had undeniably mistreated her, said heartless and cruel things to her, and even gotten "
"physically violent with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’aveva innegabilmente maltrattata, le aveva detto cose spietate e crudeli, ed era stato "
"perfino fisicamente violento con lei."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8AB2F328_F485_4FC7_83A6_FC5D21CE79D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 641b061bcc5f87a67513273901b1c7d18590e130e2081638ab0bbc19584d610f
#. default-sha256: f8e9d927155b56715124f04b95f7e51822fdb923f54a342674ea57ecc089caa0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8AB2F328_F485_4FC7_83A6_FC5D21CE79D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫His actions were inexcusable, even if they were in response to her infidelity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le sue azioni erano imperdonabili, anche se erano in risposta al tradimento di sua moglie."

#: scenario3:scenario3_647B08CC_5594_438B_BA30_D4E9D0929645
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb46994b6e31fc3aa12f96ba6620b678349a5e6169eba2ddbe3720615c16462a
#. default-sha256: 6d8cb412788907f296e749a580aac8186d5e25f1e32a559e85e203f701ffb5b6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_647B08CC_5594_438B_BA30_D4E9D0929645"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Of course, the very infidelity which had driven him to such behavior had not, in fact, taken "
"place, but he was unaware of that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ovviamente, lo stesso tradimento che lo aveva spinto a tale comportamento non era mai "
"avvenuto sul serio, ma lui questo⟪k:1⟫non lo sapeva."

#: scenario3:scenario3_385304CF_5B4C_49D0_90A2_B0F045A80595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39fa33bed45ceaa798a1bea884c7e87b0aca50c656a9a9628af7ef22f7af980b
#. default-sha256: 808e04022481f75a20a62c7073e541eeed1d86879fc55cd4ea48ce25c7fb999b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_385304CF_5B4C_49D0_90A2_B0F045A80595"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a chance they would never reconcile their misunderstandings, and that this "
"predicament would not have a positive resolution, but he still clung to a tiny fragment of hope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’era la possibilità che non avrebbero mai risolto il loro malinteso,⟪k:1⟫e che quella "
"situazione non avrebbe avuto un esito positivo,⟪k:2⟫eppure restava ancora aggrappato a quel "
"piccolo frammento di speranza che gli era rimasto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_23DE3C47_FF4D_4DD6_A52E_50ED583D252A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61555055ca1c0ecce9151968fc777c0aa3f90eab244b719895e05fac0cfd10b2
#. default-sha256: 355c8ccf82e3582cf63634791b9c9d276cb54a798cd75f2246a8505763ce3ffa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_23DE3C47_FF4D_4DD6_A52E_50ED583D252A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He wanted to start over with the White-Haired Girl, to make a new future with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Voleva ricominciare da capo con la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi,⟪k:1⟫e creare con lei un "
"nuovo futuro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_53EE63C7_F841_468E_ACF2_685521941970
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd2869f5039a0d0275584a660c171c632d5ec22d5da4dd0dc075a012d5edc50b
#. default-sha256: d1d137e9acb861e1e7da7ec83ec06e7823b4aec8c122607faae5a525a2008c12
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53EE63C7_F841_468E_ACF2_685521941970"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With that desire burning strong in his heart, he stood before the door to her shed and "
"called out to her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Con quell’ardente desiderio nel cuore, si fermò davanti alla porta del capanno, e la chiamò."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4B0BB762_4B96_4477_B69D_442908B2BD4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a684d4d0b5d4a6a3741f2593a559052e46fd1335c2dd84f3c731e634627631ef
#. default-sha256: dcd267df4febb1321234d18e8c2e64ece6bea5c7414cc5bf81741d01f0b5ff0c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4B0BB762_4B96_4477_B69D_442908B2BD4E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you awake?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It’s me, Jacopo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫May I come in?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sei sveglia?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Sono io, Jacopo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Posso entrare?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5AAE587A_3589_4AB5_8902_3829339585B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1775abac9caca9b60fd5031c9b0a6d7c6f8c829e811f4891066ed783415bdfd8
