msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non vuoi... ⟪k:2⟫nemmeno rispondermi?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫D’accordo..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A43BA456_BD46_45F6_8BFE_E661C62BA29C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f911d4a3e94b6b80eca80a62a02eae557787f6bcb272e774fc616a82394095f
