msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BD2FF15_7620_44A1_A6DC_55C3AA8107EB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Fine, then you don’t have to let me in.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But please at least hear me out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Va bene, non sei costretta a farmi entrare.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ma ti prego almeno di ascoltare "
"ciò che ho da dirti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0DCD6C30_1AA6_4355_A4E7_5D88B49F514A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed56ca52cca37a5505e70bfafaf394831e4b3030a3e4fdb5eb72258c509c2a1f
#. default-sha256: a80e9c578cc3707897aaecd59663163381556f61913986a56ddc4fecba259287
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0DCD6C30_1AA6_4355_A4E7_5D88B49F514A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Do you remember the day, shortly after we first met, when we went on our honeymoon—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫if you can even call the little walk we took a “honeymoon”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Ti ricordi il giorno della nostra luna di miele, poco dopo esserci conosciuti?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ "
"Sempre se quella piccola passeggiata possa essere considerata una “luna di miele”..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6EB8BE68_C493_4B2F_9754_C84D02B1D6D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66c31375972f76930f8dab8fdbade98d226faaecedb8cc70bf9b4034fc090fad
#. default-sha256: e681cad03b2ae708f3308f1308c089c1e288e5f0b8c10c432477b70012451571
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6EB8BE68_C493_4B2F_9754_C84D02B1D6D3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was unable to do anything nice for you then either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non sono stato capace di fare niente di buono nemmeno allora."

#: scenario3:scenario3_112CA0BD_E718_42D6_A0E1_B8C8842A7736
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2c90d77640bb18eef3811c660813e2e2b4835bcc91612f8c408c01d69ab30f2
#. default-sha256: 8547d4c8deaee2f9122abf853c1d1eb8a1810067a55688affd2152e2d3beac80
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_112CA0BD_E718_42D6_A0E1_B8C8842A7736"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had no experience, no idea how to interact with an upper-class woman like you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non avevo alcuna esperienza, nessuna idea di come comportarmi con una donna d’alto rango "
"come te."

#: scenario3:scenario3_669C4C2D_6158_40F2_B49A_7C6F9D658288
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2cead1f34bc7a2d9e1b5915939347377e42957413a15e9d28cf9683146dc08d1
#. default-sha256: b7659c56a6ae95e574b2928eef0ce03987f2d05ac224ce97ecbf83c53f123379
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_669C4C2D_6158_40F2_B49A_7C6F9D658288"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t know what I should do for you.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And yes, I know, that makes me sound "
"juvenile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non sapevo cosa avrei dovuto fare per te.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E sì, lo so che questo mi fa sembrare "
"immaturo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_10513E68_864E_4D8F_8860_24EA263673B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8b70e4e502772b6d8541006fb98d5cfd4562ba4d7752a795c99596399771159
#. default-sha256: f4505cbad8a8b2f3b116d12c854e101b7b94324a4d71a1ace5d1e74bcdde1db9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_10513E68_864E_4D8F_8860_24EA263673B2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have a tendency to say things I don’t mean the more perturbed I get."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ho la tendenza a dire cose che non penso, quando sono agitato."

#: scenario3:scenario3_33015A72_A7C7_49DD_B551_92F3AD4DB0CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0591cc79ff82c588f1fa7ac1dcafe52286f4ac688f721bf4cd9db5b4bf32953
#. default-sha256: 7f4080d28ac485f0a9ccecbc85f36fad724a43f07fea110b8b1db49f1975db34
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_33015A72_A7C7_49DD_B551_92F3AD4DB0CF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m sure I said things to hurt you numerous times that day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sono sicuro di averti detto molte cose che ti hanno ferita, quel giorno."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A9004BD_F57D_415B_A8B7_1CF5D92D76B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ccb31faaaac3d4f3fd4838c7f442494600eddfd7670f4079ce5c615eee90095
#. default-sha256: d7beb992d987b97274251bd71e1eb9729be7842be03ba82abbba7a2296e55c97
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9A9004BD_F57D_415B_A8B7_1CF5D92D76B9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫However, at the photography shop, when you saw the phenakistoscope, you smiled for me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tuttavia, al negozio di fotografie, quando hai visto il fenachistoscopio,⟪k:2⟫mi hai "
"sorriso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2464D230_600A_4746_8E3B_401DF78C5987
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7dfc4df1806dac69e4379b65d551b78c52224decfb8c58b6053640e53352f014
#. default-sha256: ec5bc7984647e7cc4ab42a15df22db5f9cd2fa4d40f92b573e3404ba055eed67
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2464D230_600A_4746_8E3B_401DF78C5987"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was... ⟪k:1⟫I was genuinely pleased in that moment."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ero... ⟪k:1⟫Ero veramente felice in quel momento."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A10FC2F_5A65_43FC_B4D6_EA158DC04EBF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d30e03a917f18354b8f94a8f650ecfe99b7696b935a014dce48904ba24dc42a
#. default-sha256: 1bbd88dfaacc6a90f16278cce06c397cf6f937dc394dc2720f35507566a3dbeb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9A10FC2F_5A65_43FC_B4D6_EA158DC04EBF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I felt like I had gotten closer to you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sentivo di essermi avvicinato a te."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7C6151C5_059E_43DA_96D1_C74626D77CBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 599f0f997fd614b60f489340a846d4478b36773ec88b7e3f20074e3c111b3fb4
#. default-sha256: 088b3069b0fa32bcc740010680058074220c49c4d7de6e62b587e8845a73f0fd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7C6151C5_059E_43DA_96D1_C74626D77CBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I very much doubt that was actually an appropriate present for a noblewoman like "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dubito fortemente che quel regalo fosse appropriato⟪k:2⟫per una nobildonna come te."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AE64D2D4_72C3_4570_9C9B_CC092ECBF7B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31cdbd2a6585b7be318e0b93fff60044dd62ef3e6fc427c4c77682fa7a06fa23
#. default-sha256: c52b802e1ba57f08ed5450ab4d6c5b570b62217d22186a22b1ca5a953cde9be8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AE64D2D4_72C3_4570_9C9B_CC092ECBF7B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jewels or flowers or something like that—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫something beautiful—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫would "
"have certainly suited you better."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dei gioielli, o dei fiori—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫insomma, qualcosa di bello—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫sarebbe stato "
"decisamente più adatto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C29791DF_946F_4063_95CC_BFE677E70E4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c76d7443bdda5194dc18fad5993c2d226f02391ae44b654d17f37990185ac09
#. default-sha256: ead7ca045e889fe716d3992a5365d536ed720f8535bcf218404cdb4a12f2efbe
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C29791DF_946F_4063_95CC_BFE677E70E4E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And I knew that, but I assumed you would have been given gifts like that countless times in "
"the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E questo lo sapevo, ma davo per scontato che avessi già ricevuto regali simili innumerevoli "
"volte in passato."

#: scenario3:scenario3_25D7D30A_890E_450B_9D32_3D08EBA4B641
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33993c82b0ebef7d351b7aaa18b2f02c1727a4480bad282aa034016f051f05d9
#. default-sha256: c9e5c6d27c8d6a02e28986f59c15eec46e7eadada3cad0d74fc5be2f04fb0dce
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_25D7D30A_890E_450B_9D32_3D08EBA4B641"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You are, after all, a beautiful woman.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I did not want to have to compete on the "
"same field as those other men."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dopotutto, sei una donna bellissima.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non volevo competere sullo stesso terreno di "
"quegli altri uomini."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1A65C782_4D12_46A1_903B_44A8BBECBA68
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b394e84b94470cf95e14cb89ce8b67f33773b8d6691191795df2da3f416022d
#. default-sha256: 5cf4f2282202e05b71e333f8b041958b680b9cb8b4db284c95d1266b3ea0bbbb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1A65C782_4D12_46A1_903B_44A8BBECBA68"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted to be special—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No, I wanted to be ⟪k:4⟫unique⟪k:5⟫ to you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Volevo essere speciale—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No, ⟪k:4⟫volevo essere ⟪k:5⟫unico⟪k:6⟫ per te."

#: scenario3:scenario3_10147F57_FE9E_489C_864D_4AD1C79148B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57a3def9ebe8fcb129f40a970765ca62f80581834e3cd254db7308d7c00c6881
#. default-sha256: 265ddbf7ec5b22d4dfa5581d373030223de80a23f97edab66093c6506993cb5d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_10147F57_FE9E_489C_864D_4AD1C79148B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No one had ever shown you anything of the sort before, had they?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nessuno ti aveva mai mostrato niente di simile prima, vero?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_24CDFCC3_5F65_48B3_A6B8_FC96CA179226
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc84f3c627146004fb75d30794cf115276349a08a21a21ff0cdbaab4536afe3e
#. default-sha256: 60e66699f22d85444c49484b6022b6eeb21c49256ccb574d6134787ab8760161
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_24CDFCC3_5F65_48B3_A6B8_FC96CA179226"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Frankly, I wasn’t sure if a woman of your status would take any interest in a "
"phenakistoscope at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Francamente, non ero affatto sicuro che una donna del tuo rango potesse nutrire alcun "
"interesse in un fenachistoscopio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_34376F6A_E076_4BBE_8B79_457847B89390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb9bc03a595c576b74332da1f707062a6d59d40b7fb6f2c77952398be5fc8cc2
#. default-sha256: f69f4251f8a2ed9fd8f08123f1674590d0f9bb7b9cf1b20a0d8639d279b0aa01
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_34376F6A_E076_4BBE_8B79_457847B89390"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine you’ve thrown it out by now,⟪k:1⟫but I choose to believe you sincerely liked it on "
"that day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Immagino che tu l’abbia gettato via, oramai,⟪k:1⟫ma voglio credere che ti sia piaciuto "
"davvero."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C51409A2_B8A6_403A_8B97_16CC37DF799A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78d8be6313fd3a59e349cad437e8e25cbdacc0c859c9d343aee4285610075bcd
#. default-sha256: 33e906878054a8c88b7ca2d3c81df577ba6e10bb97e5ec09f62dd346a5a6f99e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C51409A2_B8A6_403A_8B97_16CC37DF799A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That... ⟪k:2⟫if just for a moment... ⟪k:3⟫I caught your eye.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Even if you "
"started seeing other men afterwards,⟪k:6⟫that moment was real, wasn’t it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Voglio ricordare... ⟪k:2⟫che anche solo per un momento...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫sono riuscito a "
"catturare il tuo sguardo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Anche se poi hai cominciato a vedere altri uomini,⟪k:7⟫quel "
"momento era reale, non è così?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F6BB0F89_5D8D_4091_8F2A_70C4461515A9
